<owl:Class rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#MixingScheme">
	<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#ComputationalArtefact"/>
	<rdfs:comment>FLEUR SCF charge-density mixing (InputSchema 0.37).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Anderson">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#MixingScheme"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Default choice: alpha 0.15 converges NiZn in 17 iterations (pitfall 22b).</rdfs:comment>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Straight">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#MixingScheme"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Too conservative for hard systems: stuck at 40-260 Htr distances (pitfalls 22b, 42).</rdfs:comment>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Broyden1">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#MixingScheme"/>
	<rdfs:comment>NOT implemented in the FLEUR 6.2 build on the compute nodes (pitfall 15).</rdfs:comment>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Broyden2">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#MixingScheme"/>
	<rdfs:comment>NOT implemented in the FLEUR 6.2 build (pitfall 15).</rdfs:comment>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Anderson">
	<owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#Straight"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Anderson">
	<owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#Broyden1"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Anderson">
	<owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#Broyden2"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Straight">
	<owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#Broyden1"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Straight">
	<owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#Broyden2"/>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Broyden1">
	<owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#Broyden2"/>
</rdf:Description>
<!-- Computation layer properties -->
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasEngine">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#Engine"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Engine that runs the task.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#runsOn">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#ComputeNode"/>
	<rdfs:comment>yascheduler node the task deploys to.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasSubmitChannel">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#SubmitChannel"/>
	<rdfs:comment>AiiDA workchain vs direct API (pitfalls 17/18).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasExitCodeFamily">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#AiiDAExitCodeFamily"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Derived exit-code family.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasMixingScheme">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#MixingScheme"/>
	<rdfs:comment>SCF mixing scheme of the task.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasElement">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#DFTSystem"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Elements in the system. Range = the base ChemicalElement class. NOTE: deliberately NOT rdfs:subPropertyOf hasChemicalElements — km (Kobayashi-MaRust) has no subPropertyOf mapping; the range declaration carries the semantics.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasElement">
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ivan/ontologies/2024/0/ontomat#ChemicalElement"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasFailureMode">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#EngineFailureMode"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<!-- ================= LAYER 2: CAMPAIGN PLANS ======================= -->
<owl:Class rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#CampaignPlan">
	<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#ComputationalArtefact"/>
	<rdfs:comment>A compiled aiida-reharness campaign: systems, tasks, execution rules. The subject of the PRD gate.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>
<owl:Class rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#Observation">
	<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#ComputationalArtefact"/>
	<rdfs:comment>A runtime observation asserted for diagnosis: exit code, output signature, elements seen.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>
<owl:Class rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#ExecutionMode">
	<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#ComputationalArtefact"/>
	<rdfs:comment>How the campaign driver schedules systems.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#serial">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#ExecutionMode"/>
	<rdfs:comment>One system at a time, one engine owning all cores. House preference for DFT campaigns.</rdfs:comment>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#batch">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#ExecutionMode"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Concurrent submissions. OpenMPI resource exhaustion risk on small nodes (pitfall 20).</rdfs:comment>
</rdf:Description>
<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#serial">
	<owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#batch"/>
</rdf:Description>
<!-- Plan properties -->
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasSystem">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CampaignPlan"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#DFTSystem"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasTask">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CampaignPlan"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasExecutionMode">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CampaignPlan"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#ExecutionMode"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>
<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#prdApproved">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CampaignPlan"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
	<rdfs:comment>The reharness PRD gate: the human approves the intent (PRD), never the FSM graph. Asserted true only after the human approved the PRD.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>
<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasMitigationJUDFTWarnOnly">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
	<rdfs:comment>JUDFT_WARN_ONLY staged before the engine run (pitfalls 8c/32: heavy elements abort with &quot;Too low eigenvalue detected&quot; without it). AiiDA stages it automatically; direct API must put touch JUDFT_WARN_ONLY in the spawn command.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>
<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasMitigationSphereCaps">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Per-system MT-sphere radius caps applied via set_species (pitfall 37: inpgen auto-assigns large spheres to heavy 6s cations; differ 2 aborts at setup).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>
<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasPerSystemTemplates">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Species-level edits live in per-system templates, never in shared base templates (pitfall 38).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>
<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasSpawnNohup">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CalculationTask"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
	<rdfs:comment>nohup present in the yascheduler spawn command (pitfall 31: run_bg kills the engine when the SSH poll cycle reaps the channel; symptom: 1-3 iterations then truncated out.xml).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>
<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasBatchEvalExitZero">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#CampaignPlan"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
	<rdfs:comment>True when every evaluator CalcJob in the observed batch finished exit 0 (pitfall 42-BSD: uniform fast 412s with clean evals = infra signature, not physics).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>
<owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#hasSignatureText">
	<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://mpds.io/ontology#Observation"/>
	<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
	<rdfs:comment>Raw failure text (engine error line, parser message, log line) asserted for diagnosis.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:DatatypeProperty>
<!-- Element typing (additive over base individuals) -->
<owl:Class rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#HeavyElement">
	<rdfs:comment>f-electron elements: lanthanides + actinides. Ghost states (JUDFT_WARN_ONLY), 4f occupation fluctuation is normal (pitfalls 8c, 9).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>
<owl:Class rdf:about="https://mpds.io/ontology#LargeMTSphereElement">
	<rdfs:comment>Cations with inpgen-auto large MT spheres (2.7-2.8 bohr): high-n s valence states cannot confine; differ 2 at setup (pitfall 37).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>
